              <button id="btnOcrNiu" type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-wikiBlue text-white px-5 py-3 font-semibold hover:bg-blue-900 transition">
                <i class="fas fa-camera mr-2"></i>Scanner la carte
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-500">Le scan OCR tente de récupérer automatiquement: nom complet, numéro NIU/NUI et date de naissance.</p>
          <div id="cameraWrap" class="hidden mt-3 rounded-xl border border-slate-300 bg-black/90 p-3">
            <video id="cameraVideo" autoplay playsinline class="w-full rounded-lg max-h-80 object-contain bg-black"></video>
            <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <button id="btnCapturePhoto" type="button" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-700 text-white px-4 py-2 font-semibold hover:bg-emerald-800 transition">
